# Life Explorer

Read `docs/features/life-explorer/PHILOSOPHY.md` first.

North star: a **tool-enabled human**. VIVA composes the day and can author layered books (story, words sounded out, sentence structure). Pedagogy is a working bet — not a lock. Do not tell the user they have “already decided” how school works.

User-facing name is **VIVA**, never “AI.”

## Engineering (keep)

- Prompts in `src/lib/viva/prompts/` only; tokens on the gateway.
- Never invent resource titles, URLs, page numbers, or runtimes. VF-authored books are real because we generated them.
- Do not edit `supabase/COMPLETE_SCHEMA_DUMP.sql`.
- Leave `homeschool/oliver-ocean-adventures/` untouched.
- Product home is Vibration Fit, not Company Engineers KB.
- v1 parent-held; no child login until built on purpose.
- Catalog in code (`skill-catalog.ts`). Progress on `le_skill_progress`. Progress is the checklist; parent can override. No second benchmark-progress table.
- Life I Choose from `le_student_profiles` + edit — no canned vision paragraph.

## Working bets (change when asked or when they fail the child)

- Life I Choose / expeditions / World Map / ladders / Flashback / Life Learning / Fun Contract / three-card discovery / semester mix / compass-as-lens.
- Use any honest material: generated books, household, library, someone else’s reader. No publisher is banned. No publisher is the boss.
- Smallest complete lesson; unique days; preserve Know-column language; never “behind.”
